---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { BUY_URL, PRICE, LICENSES_EMAIL } from "../lib/product.mjs";
---

<Layout
  title="Download DiskPrune"
  description="A notarized DiskPrune.dmg is not published yet. The old GitHub v1.0.0 stub is unpublished. Scan is free; moving items to Trash needs the $19 lifetime license."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Download</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
      A notarized DiskPrune.dmg is not published yet. The previous GitHub v1.0.0
      file was an old stub and has been unpublished — do not hunt for it.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      If you already bought DiskPrune, your license key is in the email from
      {LICENSES_EMAIL}. Keep that email. Paste the key in DiskPrune → Settings →
      Licence once you have the current app.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      We will post the signed macOS build here and in that same email thread as
      soon as it is notarized. Until then, scan is free in the current app;
      moving items to Trash requires the lifetime license.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Opening an unsigned build</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Until Developer ID notarization, Gatekeeper will warn. That is expected.
    </p>
    <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
      <li>Drag DiskPrune.app to /Applications.</li>
      <li>If prompted, open System Settings → Privacy & Security.</li>
      <li>Scroll to Security and click <strong class="text-ink">Open Anyway</strong>.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={BUY_URL}>Buy lifetime — {PRICE}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/support">Support</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
